1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
Roll a die. Jump halfway to that corner.
Mark the spot. Repeat.

2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:06,900
Now cheat. Load the die: corner 1 comes up
nine times out of ten.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,300
Predict: same rule, crooked die.
A a lopsided triangle. B a different shape. C the same holes.

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:15,200
Nine rolls in ten now go to corner 1.

5
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:20,900
Crowded at the top, starved at the bottom.
Now look at the holes.

6
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:25,600
Lopsided - and not one dot in a hole.
The holes have not moved.

7
00:00:25,700 --> 00:00:29,500
Your turn: load the die yourself, then guess what
four more experiments do. interactiveexplorer.space/math-universe
